  "question": {
    "text": "The volume (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mL</mi></math>) of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math>&nbsp;required to neutralise<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>&nbsp;phosphinic acid is ____________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Phosphinic acid is hypo phosphorous acid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>NaH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>For neutrization</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>acid</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>base</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>mL</mi></msub></mfenced><mi>NaOH</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>NaOH</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math></p>"
  }
